<title>INDONESIA: Gajah Tunggal says 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Gajah Tunggal says 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in millions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			 133,529     vs   102,786</p>
<p>    Net sales			  986,867     vs   746,824</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	156     vs	 130</p>
<p>    Operating income		 149,136     vs   106,059</p>
<p>    Other income (net)		19,052     vs    45,396</p>
<p>    Minority interest		(34,659)    vs   (45,290)</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		249,487     vs   195,158</p>
<p>Note: PT Gajah Tunggal is Indonesia's largest tyre manufacturer. The results were unaudited.</p>
</text>
